<!--
    Notification icon for work in progress: a clock.

    A colourless silhouette, as the status bar requires: the system paints it in
    the theme colour itself, and a coloured icon would turn into a smudge. A
    clock, not an arrow or a triangle: the same notification covers both a model
    response and an export, and "in progress" describes both more accurately than
    "playing".
-->
